      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "group",
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "（1）最多有32个通用寄存器。因为指令中rs1、rs2字段各占5位，可表示2⁵=32个不同寄存器编号。shamt字段占5位，是因为字长为32位，移位位数范围为0~31，需要5位二进制表示。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "（2）ALUBsrc取值应为0（选择寄存器B作为ALU第二操作数）。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "F = 87654321H + 98765432H = 1FDB9753H。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "OF = 1（有符号溢出），CF = 1（无符号进位）。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "若处理无符号整数，应根据CF判断是否溢出。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "（3）因为slli指令的移位位数只使用IR[31:20]字段中的低5位（shamt），扩展器扩展的高位结果不会被使用，所以Ext取值可以是0或1。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "（4）Ext取值应为1（符号扩展偏移量），ALUctr取值应为000（ALU执行加法，计算有效地址）。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "（5）机器码A040A103H对应的二进制指令格式中，操作码IR[6:0]=0000011B（对应lw），功能码IR[14:12]=010B，符合题43图(a)中lw指令的编码规则，因此一定是lw指令。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "存储地址 = R[01H] + 符号扩展(A04H) = FFFFA2D0H + FFFFFA04H = FFFF9CD4H。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
